<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ReservasBot — Acceso</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #09090b; color: #e4e4e7; display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }

    /* LEFT PANEL */
    .left {
      flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 60px;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(124,58,237,.18) 0%, transparent 60%),
                  radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(79,70,229,.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
                  #09090b;
    }
    .left::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%237c3aed' fill-opacity='0.03'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 56px; position: relative; }
    .brand-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5);
      border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px;
    }
    .brand-name { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #fafafa; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .left-title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #fafafa; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px; position: relative; }
    .left-title span { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa, #818cf8); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    .left-sub { font-size: 16px; color: #52525b; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 380px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; position: relative; }
    .feature { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .feature-dot {
      width: 8px; height: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5);
      border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .feature-text { color: #71717a; font-size: 14px; }

    /* RIGHT PANEL */
    .right {
      width: 500px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px;
      background: #0c0c0f; border-left: 1px solid #18181b;
    }
    .card { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; }
    .card-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .card-header h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #fafafa; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .card-header p { color: #52525b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px; }

    .campo { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .campo label { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .campo input {
      width: 100%; padding: 11px 14px; background: #09090b; border: 1px solid #27272a;
      border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #e4e4e7; outline: none; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      transition: border .15s;
    }
    .campo input:focus { border-color: #7c3aed; }
    .campo input::placeholder { color: #3f3f46; }

    .btn {
      width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5);
      color: white; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2px;
      transition: opacity .15s; margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .btn:hover { opacity: .88; }

    .error {
      background: rgba(220,38,38,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.25);
      color: #f87171; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .link { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b; }
    .link a { color: #a78bfa; text-decoration: none; }
    .link a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) { .left { display: none; } .right { width: 100%; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="left">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-icon">🤖</div>
      <div class="brand-name">ReservasBot</div>
    </div>
    <div class="left-title">Tu restaurante,<br><span>siempre disponible</span></div>
    <div class="left-sub">Gestiona reservas por teléfono y WhatsApp con inteligencia artificial. Sin perder ninguna llamada.</div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature"><div class="feature-dot"></div><div class="feature-text">Atiende llamadas automáticamente 24/7</div></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="feature-dot"></div><div class="feature-text">Reservas por WhatsApp con IA conversacional</div></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="feature-dot"></div><div class="feature-text">Lista de espera y recordatorios automáticos</div></div>
      <div class="feature"><div class="feature-dot"></div><div class="feature-text">Panel de control en tiempo real</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2>Bienvenido de nuevo</h2>
        <p>Inicia sesión en tu panel de reservas</p>
      </div>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="campo">
          <label>Email</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="tu@restaurante.com" autofocus>
        </div>
        <div class="campo">
          <label>Contraseña</label>
          <input type="password" name="password" required placeholder="••••••••">
        </div>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Acceder al panel</button>
      </form>
      <div class="link">¿No tienes cuenta? <a href="/registro">Regístrate gratis</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
